/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T22:13:06-07:00","id":642613,"title":"","content":"Okay, well the way I'd put Pentex into nwod would be as a group in werewolf that figured out how to strip spirits of essence to put into,and hence mutate, objects or living things, but not relevant to demon.<br /> <br /> In demon, I'd focus Pentex as a joint operation between those demons who want to sabotage the G-M and those who want temporal power.<br /> <br /> So the sabotage would lead to the supernatural weirdness, I figure Pentex would steal infrastructure and alter it, possibly having disturbing side effects, and well the goal of temporal power would result in less than ethical practices.<br /> <br /> Or you could make pentex a company run by some of those self proclaimed technowizards from the GMC, muggles (or stigmatics) who use their unseen senses:god-machine to steal and fiddle with infrastructure at every opportunity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}